{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20964","headline":"河阳歌 · 李贺","name":"河阳歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"染罗衣，秋蓝难着色。\n不是无心人，爲作台邛客。\n花烧中潬城，颜郎身已老。\n惜许两少年，抽心似春草。\n今日见银牌，今夜鸣玉讌。\n牛头高一尺，隔坐应相见。\n月从东方来，酒从东方转。\n觥船饫口红，[蜜]炬千枝烂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20964.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20964","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}